# License texts whose slug is not the name LICENSE-binary lists the
# component (or the section) under (requirements 13 and 53; gate in
# check-asset-manifest.py, emitter in generate-archive-manifest.py).
#
# Format: slug<TAB>kind<TAB>token
#   kind = component: the text belongs to a component the manifest
#     lists; the token must appear in LICENSE-binary as a whole word,
#     case-insensitive, TODAY — a component text whose component is
#     gone is stale and fails the gate.
#   kind = section: the text is a section's generic license text; the
#     token is the manifest section title. It ships whenever the
#     section is present and is NOT staleness-checked (a section may
#     legitimately vanish when the dependency set changes and reappear
#     later; the emitter's section-coverage check fails if a present
#     section has no shipped text).
#
# Texts not listed here are matched by their slug and are treated as
# component texts (must match today). A slug listed in texts-generic
# must not appear here. A row whose text is gone fails the gate.
